OL,4,CIt is 'getting better and better' for  
OL,5,CCherries fans                          
OL,6,GAs they gathered in the bars and       
OL,7,Grestaurants of the picturesque Old     
OL,8,GTown of Vigo, on Spain's Galician      
OL,9,Gcoast, AFC Bournemouth fans were       
OL,10,Ghoping their "miraculous" record-      
OL,11,Gbreaking run would continue.           
OL,13,FThe club's first ever European         
OL,14,Fcampaign continues with a fifth game,  
OL,15,Fagainst La Liga side Celta Vigo,       
OL,16,Fhaving already secured wins against    
OL,17,Fteams including AC Milan and Sparta    
OL,18,FPrague.                                
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
