OL,4,CWoman fined after breaching 10-year    
OL,5,Canimal ban                             
OL,6,GA woman already banned from keeping    
OL,7,Ganimals admitted breaching a court     
OL,8,Gorder after cats and kittens were      
OL,9,Gfound hidden in her back garden.       
OL,11,FNatasha Walker, 34, was given the 10-  
OL,12,Fyear ban by magistrates in July 2024   
OL,13,Fafter a rabbit, puppy and dog were     
OL,14,Ffound living in dirty conditions with  
OL,15,Finadequate access to drinking water    
OL,16,Fthe year before.                       
OL,18,FBut Slough Borough Council's officers  
OL,19,Fentered Walker's home with a warrant   
OL,20,Fin July 2025 and found two cats and    
OL,21,Fthree kittens hidden behind a          
OL,22,Ftrampoline in her garden.         G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
